  "content": "<h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1140067/description_4ced7f92-af8e-4abd-a9bd-2e65f8c15c3d.png\"></strong></h1><p><strong>可自由調整與設定您想要的伽瑪值。</strong></p><p><strong>重要提醒：在1.12.2和1.20.1版本中（因特殊原因），伽瑪設定與預設亮度滑桿無連動關係，但仍可透過主介面調整（按鍵綁定可自定義）</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1140067/description_19cf18d8-ff5e-492c-a939-46476d6c9966.png\"></strong></p><blockquote>\n<h3><strong>伽瑪值調整（按<u>G鍵</u>切換）</strong></h3>\n</blockquote><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c962e3d5-2c99-47fc-9b45-f4c00febf143.png\" width=\"364\" height=\"163\"></strong></p><h3><strong>1.21.1版本中，預設亮度滑桿亦可同步調整</strong></h3><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ca0db983-7e40-4e98-8fbc-619d0c8e31c8.png\" width=\"363\" height=\"57\"></strong></p><hr><p><strong>非常歡迎將本模組加入模組包並發布至CurseForge，感謝！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
